{"id":1536,"level":40,"name":"Назви фігури","group":"Практика","format":35,"description":"<p>In this lesson, you will practise the names of the chess pieces.&nbsp;Do you know how&nbsp;the chessmen are called?&nbsp;</p>  <table height='360' style='width: 165px;'>  <tbody>  <tr>  <td style='width: 61px;'><img src='chessity/assets/illustrations/67593c88e88d90ae.png' alt='' width='50' height='50' /></td>  <td style='width: 88px;'>  <h4>the pawn</h4>  </td>  </tr>  <tr>  <td style='width: 61px;'><img src='chessity/assets/illustrations/b36caaf22b0e829f.png' alt='' width='50' height='50' /></td>  <td style='width: 88px;'>  <h4>the knight</h4>  </td>  </tr>  <tr>  <td style='width: 61px;'><img src='chessity/assets/illustrations/e4cf40671e7539ea.png' alt='' width='50' height='50' /></td>  <td style='width: 88px;'>  <h4>the bishop</h4>  </td>  </tr>  <tr>  <td style='width: 61px;'><img src='chessity/assets/illustrations/83cf0dbb6682a35c.png' alt='' width='50' height='50' /></td>  <td style='width: 88px;'>  <h4>the rook</h4>  </td>  </tr>  <tr>  <td style='width: 61px;'><img src='chessity/assets/illustrations/c111ce61f04d7908.png' alt='' width='50' height='50' /></td>  <td style='width: 88px;'>  <h4>the queen</h4>  </td>  </tr>  <tr>  <td style='width: 61px;'><img src='chessity/assets/illustrations/7302c122ffb28a99.png' alt='' width='50' height='50' /></td>  <td style='width: 88px;'>  <h4>the king</h4>  </td>  </tr>  </tbody>  </table>  <p><br />Each of the pieces moves in its own way. You already know that. Do you remember how the pieces move?&nbsp;<br /><br /></p>  <h3><strong>What do you have to do?</strong></h3>  <p>First, collect the coins. Next, grab the flag. Then, you will get a question. You have to name the piece that you just used. Click on the correct answer.</p>","assignment":"","stickerID":0,"examples":[],"puzzles":[{"id":36034,"fen":"8/F7/2c5/8/3c4/5N2/8/8 w - 0 1 $YY","pgn":"1. Nd4 -- 2. Nc6 -- 3. Na7  1-0","format":35,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":5,"multiThe